  "method": "One background thread. 16 staged local AF_UNIX flows. The two-worker drain argument and 512 KiB read cap are identical. Flat uses create_data and nested uses create. A 16 KiB classification wave and one full workload wave precede timing in every process. Each timed wave queues one 4 or 512 KiB write per flow, calls the native drain once, and reads and compares every byte with its flow- and wave-tagged input. 32 MiB verified per sample. Both FINs and retirement checked. Owner CPU covers drains. Wall throughput includes producers, consumers and byte comparison on the same thread. No VM, network, dispatch or fresh marker. Setup, classification and teardown excluded. One timed binary for both arms. ASan/UBSan qualifies all four cells; one untimed sample per cell. 12 matched pairs per size with alternating AB/BA. Intervals resample the within-block ratios (10,000 draws, seed 7317).",
